WEBVTT

00:00:00.668 --> 00:00:05.965
I will show the entire
world my desire for change!

00:00:06.174 --> 00:00:09.677
Yes. It doesn't matter who I am.

00:00:09.886 --> 00:00:11.637
I'll do as I must.

00:00:11.846 --> 00:00:15.224
My Unrestricted Method still lacks power.

00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:19.437
What I must do is...

00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:22.815
All military forces, advance!

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:46.005
<i>Now set free</i>

00:00:46.214 --> 00:00:52.386
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:00:52.595 --> 00:00:56.265
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:00:56.474 --> 00:01:02.188
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:04.857
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:01:05.066 --> 00:01:07.485
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:10.029
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:01:10.238 --> 00:01:14.909
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:17.453
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:01:17.662 --> 00:01:20.122
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:20.331 --> 00:01:22.750
<i>Your existence</i>

00:01:22.959 --> 00:01:27.838
<i>Cry out</i>

00:01:28.047 --> 00:01:30.258
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:30.633 --> 00:01:33.010
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:33.219 --> 00:01:35.596
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:01:35.805 --> 00:01:43.729
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:50.319
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:01:55.574 --> 00:01:58.327
I'm sorry to arrange this
for so early in the morning.

00:01:58.536 --> 00:02:02.206
You can leave on a good note.

00:02:02.415 --> 00:02:04.750
I wish Sato had made it in time.

00:02:04.959 --> 00:02:09.630
Well, you can say hi to him next time.

00:02:09.839 --> 00:02:13.134
Please convey my thanks to
Eita Tanaka and Keisaku Sato

00:02:13.342 --> 00:02:15.845
for everything they've done,

00:02:16.053 --> 00:02:22.727
in addition to my instructions
for Margery Daw's care, indeed.

00:02:22.935 --> 00:02:25.271
And we are, of course, very grateful

00:02:25.479 --> 00:02:26.731
to you, as well.

00:02:26.939 --> 00:02:30.651
Aw... Don't talk like that.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.528
I won't ask you
to let me be part of this.

00:02:32.737 --> 00:02:35.698
Just do what you can for them.

00:02:35.906 --> 00:02:40.244
We'll catch up later. Leave some for us.

00:02:40.453 --> 00:02:42.747
Understood, indeed.

00:02:42.955 --> 00:02:44.707
Reunite later.

00:02:44.915 --> 00:02:46.751
I won't tell you that I'll stay here.

00:02:46.959 --> 00:02:49.670
If this battle will determine
whether the world changes,

00:02:49.879 --> 00:02:53.341
each of us is already a part of it.

00:02:53.549 --> 00:02:57.553
Therefore, at least,
I'll wish you all good fortune.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:14.028
"The War Begins"

00:03:15.363 --> 00:03:16.947
It's been several days since the main

00:03:17.156 --> 00:03:19.825
Ball Masque army
left the Palace of the Stars.

00:03:20.034 --> 00:03:23.662
I wonder whether the battle
has begun somewhere else.

00:03:23.871 --> 00:03:24.747
No.

00:03:24.955 --> 00:03:26.332
Not somewhere...

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:30.378
Everywhere.
Probably all over the world.

00:03:30.586 --> 00:03:33.714
But the Trinity isn't
on any of those battlefields.

00:03:34.715 --> 00:03:36.759
Thousand Changes Sydonay.

00:03:36.967 --> 00:03:39.345
Bel-Peol, the Judge of Paradoxes.

00:03:39.553 --> 00:03:42.014
Hecate, the Supreme Throne.

00:03:42.223 --> 00:03:45.684
If they're not there,
we must be able to do something.

00:03:45.893 --> 00:03:47.186
Even if we can't,

00:03:47.395 --> 00:03:51.065
Sophie Sawallisch
will think of something.

00:03:51.857 --> 00:03:53.359
Something will happen...

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:55.986
So for now, I'll wait.

00:03:56.195 --> 00:03:58.030
I'll wait for that time to come.

00:03:58.239 --> 00:04:00.241
We're finished.

00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:12.086
I wonder if Wilhelmina

00:04:12.294 --> 00:04:14.880
is fighting somewhere.

00:04:58.299 --> 00:05:00.134
Speedy execution.

00:05:03.471 --> 00:05:05.556
Understood, indeed.

00:05:10.227 --> 00:05:11.312
She's late!

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:14.106
What is Wilhelmina doing?

00:05:14.315 --> 00:05:16.275
It hasn't even been a half hour.

00:05:16.484 --> 00:05:20.196
You don't think
we should help her?

00:05:20.404 --> 00:05:25.159
Oh, yeah...
She lived there for a long time.

00:05:25.367 --> 00:05:29.538
We should be understanding
of why she wanted to go alone.

00:05:29.747 --> 00:05:32.625
Yes, that's true.

00:05:33.792 --> 00:05:35.878
Fine, I'll wait.

00:05:37.046 --> 00:05:38.672
She's late!

00:05:47.556 --> 00:05:50.518
Please grant me power...

00:05:50.726 --> 00:05:53.729
Palace of Heaven's Road, surface.

00:06:29.431 --> 00:06:32.434
Wow!

00:06:55.749 --> 00:07:01.755
"Zurich Outlaw HQ"

00:07:01.755 --> 00:07:02.172
for the Eastern Theater is Japan?

00:07:02.381 --> 00:07:05.134
Indeed. They'll seek to push

00:07:05.342 --> 00:07:09.054
our defensive lines back to America.

00:07:11.307 --> 00:07:13.225
S-Supreme Commander!

00:07:13.434 --> 00:07:16.770
Tokyo, is it?

00:07:16.979 --> 00:07:19.064
I'm impressed you knew.

00:07:19.982 --> 00:07:23.235
At present, that would be the only
front requiring an emergency report.

00:07:23.444 --> 00:07:25.362
Tell us the details.

00:07:26.697 --> 00:07:29.950
Contact with the
Tokyo HQ has been lost.

00:07:33.662 --> 00:07:35.748
It's been trapped within a Seal,

00:07:35.956 --> 00:07:37.958
and the war has begun.

00:07:47.676 --> 00:07:50.095
Fire second barrage!

00:07:55.392 --> 00:07:58.729
Artillery squads, fire at will.

00:07:58.937 --> 00:08:01.065
Ignore the broken Rinne.

00:08:01.273 --> 00:08:02.941
We're ready! Attack squads...

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:04.568
Charge!

00:08:08.822 --> 00:08:11.075
Heavy damage to Central Park!

00:08:11.283 --> 00:08:14.036
Enemy reserve forces
have appeared in Shrine Garden.

00:08:14.244 --> 00:08:16.288
At this rate, they'll breach
West Sandoguchi Intersection.

00:08:16.497 --> 00:08:18.457
The Choja Bashi Defense
Force has been routed.

00:08:18.666 --> 00:08:21.752
Northern forces report they're falling
back to the Shimizu Bashi intersection.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:26.674
Curse that Ribesal.
He fights as proficiently as ever.

00:08:26.882 --> 00:08:30.511
W-Will we be okay?
If Ribesal's here, then...

00:08:30.719 --> 00:08:34.723
Commander, one of the northern squads
has initiated a frontal assault on the enemy!

00:08:34.932 --> 00:08:36.350
What?

00:08:43.023 --> 00:08:45.275
We're doing well. They thought
they had the advantage, and relaxed.

00:08:45.484 --> 00:08:47.486
Break through their lines!

00:08:50.364 --> 00:08:51.990
Illusion magic?

00:08:55.869 --> 00:08:57.871
No... Hold your breath!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.374
It's the Unrestricted Method Daim6n!

00:09:03.877 --> 00:09:05.504
They lured us in.

00:09:05.713 --> 00:09:07.464
Wake him, even if
it takes a hard punch.

00:09:07.673 --> 00:09:09.508
If we stay here...

00:09:16.724 --> 00:09:18.142
Too easy.

00:09:19.268 --> 00:09:23.021
The northern lines
are in disarray! It's a rout!

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:24.982
They should have listened to me.

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:29.069
Hey, Frieder-kun,
aren't we in danger here, too?

00:09:29.278 --> 00:09:32.281
That's true, Brigid.

00:09:33.198 --> 00:09:37.035
We are abandoning
the Third Command Room.

00:09:37.244 --> 00:09:40.080
All personnel, withdraw to
the Second Command Room.

00:09:40.289 --> 00:09:40.706
Yes, Sir.

00:09:40.914 --> 00:09:43.917
Withdraw! Get a message to the front lines!

00:09:44.126 --> 00:09:46.086
I'll go.

00:09:46.295 --> 00:09:49.131
If anything happens,
obey my second-in-command.

00:09:49.339 --> 00:09:50.340
But...

00:09:50.549 --> 00:09:53.886
I-I-I think we'll probably be okay!

00:09:54.094 --> 00:09:56.430
Let us go, Miss.

00:09:56.638 --> 00:09:58.265
O-Okay.

00:10:07.691 --> 00:10:08.817
I'll take charge here.

00:10:09.026 --> 00:10:11.737
You retreat to Juniso Street!

00:10:11.945 --> 00:10:15.073
It's been quite a long, long time.

00:10:15.282 --> 00:10:18.327
Seventy or eighty years, Ernest?

00:10:18.535 --> 00:10:22.372
No... They all call you Frieder.

00:10:22.581 --> 00:10:25.542
Ribesal, I see that,
despite your rank as general,

00:10:25.751 --> 00:10:28.754
you still cling to your bad
habit of fighting on the front lines.

00:10:28.962 --> 00:10:31.340
Must be hard on Pirsoyn.

00:10:31.548 --> 00:10:33.175
Shut up!

00:10:50.317 --> 00:10:53.153
Your tricks won't save you!

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.286
Over there?

00:11:10.629 --> 00:11:12.256
Now you're mine!

00:11:13.507 --> 00:11:15.050
Status report from the Tokyo HQ,

00:11:15.259 --> 00:11:18.387
from a messenger
who went outside the Seal.

00:11:18.595 --> 00:11:22.057
Enemy commander, Dashing Earthly
Fiend Ribesal, confirmed.

00:11:22.266 --> 00:11:26.353
As planned, we met him in Shinjuku.

00:11:26.562 --> 00:11:29.064
So we've correctly identified
the location of their main forces.

00:11:29.273 --> 00:11:31.900
Any change on the Western Front?

00:11:32.109 --> 00:11:34.152
Nothing of note.

00:11:34.361 --> 00:11:36.196
There appear to be no major changes.

00:11:36.405 --> 00:11:39.324
Essentially, their attack
remains as strong as ever.

00:11:39.533 --> 00:11:42.077
These difficulties were anticipated.

00:11:42.077 --> 00:11:44.454
"Romania"

00:11:44.538 --> 00:11:46.498
the Western Theater's lines,
Andrei Fortress,

00:11:46.707 --> 00:11:49.585
is besieged by Haborym,
the Burning Agitation.

00:11:49.793 --> 00:11:53.297
Even if it's a diversion,
they won't let up.

00:12:01.096 --> 00:12:04.850
The same holds for us.

00:12:05.058 --> 00:12:06.810
If we can't prove we're serious,

00:12:07.019 --> 00:12:10.647
it will negatively impact our future plans.

00:12:10.772 --> 00:12:13.108
"Greece"

00:12:13.108 --> 00:12:13.233
Yes. The other bases

00:12:13.442 --> 00:12:17.321
have sustained serious damage,
but none have fallen.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:21.867
II I.

00:12:21.867 --> 00:12:24.036
There's never been a conflict

00:12:24.244 --> 00:12:26.079
with such large fronts.

00:12:26.288 --> 00:12:30.167
And to make it even crazier,
all of these are mere diversions.

00:12:30.375 --> 00:12:32.044
The Judge of Paradoxes

00:12:32.252 --> 00:12:35.130
is already looking past this skirmish.

00:12:35.339 --> 00:12:37.591
Should one of these fronts fall,

00:12:37.799 --> 00:12:40.552
we'll be too busy rebuilding
our lines to do anything else.

00:12:40.761 --> 00:12:43.722
However, in this dual-front war,

00:12:43.931 --> 00:12:45.682
with the enemy deploying
their massive armies,

00:12:45.891 --> 00:12:50.479
only a minimal number of Denizens
should remain at the Palace of the Stars.

00:12:52.064 --> 00:12:56.276
Our true objective, a surprise
attack on the Palace of the Stars...

00:12:56.485 --> 00:12:59.112
It will be a difficult path to tread.

00:12:59.321 --> 00:13:03.992
But we must wager on the hope
we've gained from that information.

00:13:05.577 --> 00:13:06.453
Unfortunately,

00:13:06.662 --> 00:13:10.707
the Thousand Changes has
not appeared on any battlefield.

00:13:10.916 --> 00:13:15.003
Then our greatest obstacle

00:13:15.212 --> 00:13:16.964
is the Trinity.

00:13:17.172 --> 00:13:19.675
Yes, we must be prepared.

00:13:22.636 --> 00:13:23.637
What's wrong?

00:13:24.638 --> 00:13:26.056
The Four Gods of the Earth...

00:13:26.264 --> 00:13:28.475
The Beckoner of Brightened Dew,

00:13:28.684 --> 00:13:30.310
Centerhill?

00:13:40.612 --> 00:13:42.280
What was that?

00:13:42.489 --> 00:13:45.909
We would like
you to prepare a place

00:13:46.118 --> 00:13:48.078
in your camp for us.

00:13:48.286 --> 00:13:52.708
So, we may expect aid from the
Four Gods of Earth in this battle?

00:13:52.916 --> 00:13:56.628
No, I've come,
representing the other three,

00:13:56.837 --> 00:13:58.880
simply to observe.

00:13:59.089 --> 00:14:01.925
We must see if this is
where we should make our stand.

00:14:02.134 --> 00:14:07.431
Ball Masque is attempting to
revive the Creator God.

00:14:07.639 --> 00:14:11.184
This threat is dire,
but you would remain uncertain?

00:14:11.393 --> 00:14:13.437
We four priests received power

00:14:13.645 --> 00:14:16.857
from those Crimson Lords
regarded as gods.

00:14:17.065 --> 00:14:21.236
And for years, we have destroyed
the evil spirits known as Denizens.

00:14:21.445 --> 00:14:25.365
And after a great length
of time, we thought thus...

00:14:25.574 --> 00:14:27.492
The Denizens who make contracts as gods,

00:14:27.701 --> 00:14:30.370
and those who prowl
the Earth as evil spirits,

00:14:30.579 --> 00:14:34.875
are both a part of the natural order
that's been a foundation of this world

00:14:35.083 --> 00:14:36.918
since time immemorial.

00:14:37.127 --> 00:14:41.923
Therefore, I have come to see what
that Crimson Denizen among them,

00:14:42.132 --> 00:14:46.303
who bears the title
of a "god," wishes to do.

00:14:46.511 --> 00:14:50.390
Especially if he desires
to change the natural order.

00:14:50.599 --> 00:14:54.519
So, in other words, once you ascertain
Ball Masque's true intentions,

00:14:54.728 --> 00:14:57.397
you will clarify your position?

00:14:57.606 --> 00:14:58.190
Yes.

00:14:58.398 --> 00:15:02.694
Then it's still possible
you will decide to help us, yes?

00:15:04.404 --> 00:15:05.989
Very well.

00:15:06.198 --> 00:15:09.367
We shall grant you a place at our table.

00:15:11.203 --> 00:15:14.790
Saboteur teams are currently
placed at radar stations all over Europe.

00:15:14.998 --> 00:15:18.543
Initial transports have departed.

00:15:18.752 --> 00:15:22.297
The second and third
are on schedule as well.

00:15:22.506 --> 00:15:23.548
Everything looks good.

00:15:23.757 --> 00:15:27.094
I'm impressed that you've
accomplished this on such short notice.

00:15:27.302 --> 00:15:30.472
Well, we have
been working at the Outlaw

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:33.391
for several hundred years.

00:15:35.435 --> 00:15:37.562
I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

00:15:37.771 --> 00:15:41.525
Calm yourself, Adjutant Frangois Auric.

00:15:41.733 --> 00:15:46.404
The fate of the world
rests upon your judgment.

00:15:46.613 --> 00:15:48.031
Yes.

00:15:48.824 --> 00:15:53.245
The path to life is found
only beyond death's horizon.

00:15:53.453 --> 00:15:54.788
Is that it?

00:15:54.996 --> 00:15:57.707
The real fight is just beginning.

00:16:02.003 --> 00:16:04.256
It will get stormy.

00:16:04.464 --> 00:16:08.009
Excellent! Exciting!

00:16:08.218 --> 00:16:13.640
Never before seen! Never before
heard of! Never before imagined!

00:16:13.849 --> 00:16:15.725
So this is the Path of Pilgrimage.

00:16:15.934 --> 00:16:20.814
You created such a vast structure
here, in the rift between worlds?

00:16:21.022 --> 00:16:24.526
Only a god could accomplish such a feat!

00:16:24.734 --> 00:16:28.655
Indeed. I used my power to make this...

00:16:28.864 --> 00:16:33.952
This narrow, fragile, tiny path to myself.

00:16:34.161 --> 00:16:35.662
We travel the path before us.

00:16:35.871 --> 00:16:39.457
There is but one path to take.

00:16:39.666 --> 00:16:44.379
The Path of Pilgrimage isn't
quite as simple as it appears.

00:16:44.588 --> 00:16:48.341
It is a transient thing,
constructed by the crafting

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:52.345
of suffering, privations, and
impossibilities into a physical path,

00:16:52.554 --> 00:16:54.264
using the power of a god.

00:16:54.472 --> 00:16:59.019
Thus, it may only be traversed
by following the Priestess,

00:16:59.227 --> 00:17:04.733
who first off, follows
the Insignia linked to the god.

00:17:04.941 --> 00:17:08.236
And second, uses her own
ability to resonate with his works.

00:17:08.445 --> 00:17:11.072
That is correct, Strategist.

00:17:11.281 --> 00:17:14.993
Currently, the Path of
Pilgrimage is 54% materialized.

00:17:15.202 --> 00:17:19.456
Under some circumstances,
that may drop as low as 34%.

00:17:19.664 --> 00:17:21.708
But don't worry about a thing!

00:17:21.917 --> 00:17:24.085
As long as we know the direction,

00:17:24.294 --> 00:17:28.673
there isn't even a microscopic
chance we could get lost!

00:17:30.133 --> 00:17:33.220
Let us go. The path is long.

00:17:34.679 --> 00:17:37.599
Again and again, I seek the path,

00:17:37.807 --> 00:17:41.186
but all that returns to me
is the sound of wind and sand.

00:17:44.856 --> 00:17:48.526
Reporting in, to Fortress Commander
Fecor, the Tempest Hoof.

00:17:48.735 --> 00:17:50.862
Go ahead, Officer of Boundless
Seas Decarabia,

00:17:51.071 --> 00:17:53.949
Supreme Commander of the
Offensive Forces attacking Outlaw.

00:17:54.157 --> 00:17:55.617
Any change in the battle?

00:17:55.825 --> 00:17:59.329
All forces advance as planned.

00:17:59.537 --> 00:18:00.288
But...

00:18:00.497 --> 00:18:01.373
But?

00:18:01.581 --> 00:18:06.253
There is no sign of the Braider of
Trembling Might, Sophie Sawallisch.

00:18:06.461 --> 00:18:11.549
Perhaps she waits somewhere
for the General's arrival?

00:18:11.758 --> 00:18:13.009
Possible.

00:18:13.218 --> 00:18:15.011
An obvious possibility.

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:16.096
However,

00:18:16.304 --> 00:18:18.056
Fortress Commander,

00:18:18.265 --> 00:18:21.142
I request permission
to prepare my forces,

00:18:21.351 --> 00:18:23.937
which guard the
Palace of the Stars, for battle.

00:18:24.145 --> 00:18:25.522
The forces here?

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:28.817
Covered as it is by
a shell of concealment,

00:18:29.025 --> 00:18:32.070
you cannot believe there will be a
surprise attack on the Palace of the Stars?

00:18:32.279 --> 00:18:34.155
Have you seen some sort of sign?

00:18:34.364 --> 00:18:35.448
I have not.

00:18:35.657 --> 00:18:37.409
I am further aware that,

00:18:37.617 --> 00:18:41.830
in its hundreds of years since construction,
an enemy has never detected it.

00:18:42.038 --> 00:18:42.789
Then“.

00:18:42.998 --> 00:18:44.666
Intuition.

00:18:44.874 --> 00:18:47.168
Everything goes too smoothly.

00:18:47.377 --> 00:18:51.631
The Flame Hazes should be far
more dangerous than this.

00:18:53.174 --> 00:18:56.303
Understood. Permission is granted.

00:18:56.511 --> 00:19:01.850
Our duty is to protect the Palace
of the Stars until the master's return.

00:19:02.058 --> 00:19:02.517
Then,

00:19:02.726 --> 00:19:05.437
I shall arrange the deployment.

00:19:12.152 --> 00:19:13.570
Why?

00:19:15.113 --> 00:19:18.867
Why did my Unrestricted
Method not work on Yuji?

00:19:19.075 --> 00:19:21.786
Was it too weak to affect him?

00:19:21.995 --> 00:19:26.374
Or was I ignorant of how to use it?

00:19:26.583 --> 00:19:28.460
I don't know.

00:19:28.668 --> 00:19:32.505
Back then, it was so easy to say goodbye.

00:19:32.714 --> 00:19:35.550
Even still, I want to see him...

00:19:36.801 --> 00:19:39.387
I want to see Yuji!

00:19:39.596 --> 00:19:42.474
Right now, he is the master of Ball Masque.

00:19:42.682 --> 00:19:45.352
And I am the Flame-Haired
Burning-Eyed Slayer.

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.771
Even if I could meet him,
we would only fight.

00:19:47.979 --> 00:19:50.607
But even so...

00:19:50.815 --> 00:19:52.776
I want to see Yuji!

00:19:52.984 --> 00:19:56.571
I want to see him
and find out for myself.

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:59.657
The period of deceiving
yourself is now over.

00:19:59.866 --> 00:20:04.496
The time has come to unite you and you.

00:20:04.704 --> 00:20:07.040
The me that is a Flame Haze,

00:20:07.248 --> 00:20:09.542
and the other me,
that's everything else.

00:20:09.751 --> 00:20:12.379
To strike him with
what couldn't reach last time,

00:20:12.587 --> 00:20:14.589
and to learn the answer.

00:20:14.798 --> 00:20:17.050
With the strongest Unrestricted Method,

00:20:18.218 --> 00:20:20.470
this love...

00:20:20.678 --> 00:20:21.971
However,

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:24.349
I cannot do
that now, while I'm a captive.

00:20:24.557 --> 00:20:29.604
When I see him, I must be my true self,
with my Flame Haze power,

00:20:29.813 --> 00:20:33.608
so I can discover what
I will do, or there isn't any point.

00:20:33.817 --> 00:20:35.944
For that to happen,
I need things to change.

00:20:36.152 --> 00:20:39.197
Enough to destroy everything
that's happening now.

00:20:41.241 --> 00:20:43.201
I cannot accept this!

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:46.663
As we speak, a greater battle
than any in history occurs.

00:20:46.871 --> 00:20:48.665
Why must we remain here?

00:20:48.873 --> 00:20:52.043
As we are, we won't
defeat even a single enemy.

00:20:52.252 --> 00:20:53.628
Stop whining.

00:20:53.837 --> 00:20:58.633
The master ordered us
to defend the Palace of the Stars.

00:20:58.842 --> 00:21:00.927
Defend it from what?

00:21:01.136 --> 00:21:04.305
The enemy isn't coming here...

00:21:04.514 --> 00:21:05.598
What's wrong?

00:21:05.807 --> 00:21:07.600
What's that?

00:21:07.809 --> 00:21:08.977
Sheesh...

00:21:09.185 --> 00:21:12.230
There's a tremendous conflict outside,

00:21:12.439 --> 00:21:15.567
and we're stuck
in this musty old castle...

00:21:21.156 --> 00:21:22.574
<i>Yo'.!</i>

00:21:23.533 --> 00:21:26.661
Hello. And farewell.

00:21:32.459 --> 00:21:37.630
<i>I must be dreaming tonight</i>

00:21:37.797 --> 00:21:40.091
Yeah, that's right.

00:21:40.091 --> 00:21:43.052
<i>We erase it from our memories</i>

00:21:43.052 --> 00:21:43.178
First, let us head for
the outside of the castle.

00:21:43.261 --> 00:21:45.054
<i>You can't escape</i>

00:21:45.054 --> 00:21:48.266
Deploy Qadesh's Blood Seal.

00:21:48.266 --> 00:21:50.435
<i>I only know this secret with you</i>

00:21:52.187 --> 00:21:53.438
Constructing Unrestricted System:

00:21:53.438 --> 00:21:57.358
<i>"I'll believe..."</i>

00:21:57.358 --> 00:21:57.567
Deploying-

00:22:01.905 --> 00:22:04.866
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:04.866 --> 00:22:09.954
Qadesh's Blood Pulse.

00:22:09.954 --> 00:22:11.623
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:11.623 --> 00:22:12.415
Get 90mg-

00:22:12.415 --> 00:22:17.587
<i>It is the reason why
I continue to exist</i>

00:22:17.795 --> 00:22:18.880
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:19.047 --> 00:22:20.632
We'd better get started, too!

00:22:20.632 --> 00:22:22.175
<i>How can I make you know
my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:22.175 --> 00:22:24.552
Let's start breaking things.

00:22:24.552 --> 00:22:25.595
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:25.803 --> 00:22:28.973
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:29.182 --> 00:22:32.310
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:32.393 --> 00:22:33.394
It's here!

00:22:33.394 --> 00:22:35.688
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:35.688 --> 00:22:36.606
A change so big, it will destroy
everything that's happening.

00:22:36.606 --> 00:22:39.609
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:39.817 --> 00:22:42.529
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:42.737 --> 00:22:50.787
<i>The vanishing afterimage, that is you
in and of itself (So now that you & I)</i>

00:22:50.995 --> 00:22:52.038
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:52.247 --> 00:22:53.998
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:54.207 --> 00:22:57.627
<i>“I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:57.835 --> 00:23:00.964
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:01.172 --> 00:23:04.384
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:04.592 --> 00:23:07.428
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:07.637 --> 00:23:11.182
<i>ls also inside of me
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:11.391 --> 00:23:14.310
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:14.519 --> 00:23:23.027
<i>“I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:26.072 --> 00:23:27.824
Rebecca and Khamsin's attack

00:23:28.032 --> 00:23:30.743
plunges the Palace of the Stars into chaos.

00:23:30.952 --> 00:23:35.498
Amidst the confusion,
Shana awaits her moment to act.

00:23:35.707 --> 00:23:37.834
Next time, on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:38.042 --> 00:23:39.836
"To the Palace of the Stars."
